---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Truth or Dare Online – Play with Strangers Anonymously | Airwalk Blog" description="Play Truth or Dare online with anonymous strangers on Airwalk. Spill secrets, accept dares, and make every chat unforgettable.">
  <header class="fixed top-0 w-full z-50 bg-gray-900/80 backdrop-blur-md border-b border-gray-800">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 md:px-8 py-4 flex items-center justify-between">
      <a href="/" class="text-2xl font-bold text-white">Airwalk</a>
      <a href="/chat" class="bg-purple-600 hover:bg-purple-700 text-white px-5 py-2 rounded-full text-sm font-medium transition">Start Chatting</a>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 md:px-8 py-12 space-y-6 mt-20">
    <article class="space-y-6">
      <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold text-white">Truth or Dare Online: The Classic Game, Reimagined for Strangers</h1>
      <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm">Published on May 28, 2026</p>

      <p class="text-gray-300">Truth or Dare has been making parties memorable for decades. Now imagine playing it with a complete stranger — someone who has no context about your life, no mutual friends, no judgment. That's Truth or Dare on Airwalk, and it's wildly entertaining.</p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-white">How Truth or Dare Works on Airwalk</h2>
      <p class="text-gray-300">Start a game during any chat session. Players take turns choosing truth or dare. Airwalk provides curated prompts ranging from lighthearted to surprisingly deep — or you can create custom questions for your partner. Truths make you reveal something real. Dares challenge you to do something bold. Skip any prompt you're uncomfortable with, no questions asked.</p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-white">Why It Works Better with Strangers</h2>
      <p class="text-gray-300">Playing Truth or Dare with friends has limits — you already know their secrets, and social consequences hold people back. With anonymous strangers, those barriers vanish. People are more honest in their truths and more adventurous with their dares because there's zero real-world fallout. The anonymity creates freedom.</p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-white">From Game to Genuine Connection</h2>
      <p class="text-gray-300">What starts as a fun game often evolves into a real conversation. A truth question about your biggest fear leads to a deep discussion about vulnerability. A silly dare leads to shared laughter that breaks every wall down. Truth or Dare is the spark — the connection that follows is the fire.</p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-white">Curated Prompts for Every Vibe</h2>
      <p class="text-gray-300">Airwalk offers prompt categories to match your mood — Casual, Spicy, Deep, and Funny. Choose your comfort level and the questions adapt. Whether you want lighthearted fun or soul-baring honesty, there's a Truth or Dare experience that fits.</p>

      <p class="text-gray-300">Pick your poison — truth or dare? Either way, the conversation is about to get interesting.</p>
    </article>

    <div class="text-center py-8 border-t border-gray-800">
      <p class="text-gray-300 mb-4">Ready to play Truth or Dare with strangers?</p>
      <a href="/chat" class="inline-block bg-purple-600 hover:bg-purple-700 text-white px-8 py-3 rounded-full font-medium transition">Play Truth or Dare</a>
    </div>
  </main>

  <footer class="border-t border-gray-800 py-8 text-center text-gray-500 text-sm">
    <p>&copy; 2026 Airwalk. All rights reserved.</p>
  </footer>
</Layout>
